{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 0,
    "dDurationMs": 9180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003c디디와 정태웅의 한국생활 요모조모 \u003e\n\u003cDidi and Taewoong’s Many Sides of Life in Korea\u003e"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9180,
    "dDurationMs": 2050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "안녕하세요 디디입니다!\nHello, I’m Didi!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11230,
    "dDurationMs": 1930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "안녕하세요 정태웅입니다\nHello, I’m Taewoong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 13160,
    "dDurationMs": 3050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003c한국생활 요모조모\u003e는 한국에서 살아가는 두 사람이\n\u003cMany Sides of Life in Korea\u003e is a podcast where two people living in Korea"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 16210,
    "dDurationMs": 3820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "한국생활의 요모조모를 이야기하는 팟캐스트입니다\ntalk about the many sides of life in Korea."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20030,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "오늘 주제는 뭐였죠?\nWhat was today’s topic again?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 22730,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "오늘의 주제는 바로바로 '여름'입니다\nToday’s topic is, drumroll please... “summer.”"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25950,
    "dDurationMs": 3430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "여름! 거의 여름이 끝났어요\nSummer! It’s almost over."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 29380,
    "dDurationMs": 4270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "한국에서는 말복이라고 하는 것도 지나갔죠?\nIn Korea, the last of the dog days has passed too, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 33650,
    "dDurationMs": 1190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "지나갔나요?\nHas it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34840,
    "dDurationMs": 1610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "말복 지나갔어요\nThe last of the dog days has passed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36450,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아니요 여름이 지나갔냐고요\nNo, I mean has summer passed?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 38450,
    "dDurationMs": 2530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아, 여름이요?\nOh, summer?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40980,
    "dDurationMs": 1610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "왜요? 더워요? 너무?\nWhy? Is it hot? Too hot?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 42590,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "너무 더워요\nIt’s way too hot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43890,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아, 그런가?\nOh, is that so?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45180,
    "dDurationMs": 580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네\nYeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45760,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "다시 해할래요, 그러면\nLet’s do that again, then."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47240,
    "dDurationMs": 1810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "자, 여름이 한창인데요\nOkay, it’s the height of summer now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 49050,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "지금 이 영상이 올라갈 때쯤은\nBy the time this video goes up,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 52570,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "여름이 이제 좀 꺾이는 그런 시즌이지 않을까 하거든요\nI think summer will be starting to wind down a bit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 56530,
    "dDurationMs": 2350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "9월 초쯤 올라갈 것 같은데...\nIt’ll probably go up around early September..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58880,
    "dDurationMs": 2270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아직 너무 덥다구요?\nStill too hot, you say?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61150,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네 이걸 찍는 8월 20일 오늘은 너무 덥습니다\nYeah, today, August 20th, when we’re filming this, it’s so hot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 65250,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "밖에 나갔다 오셨어요 오늘도?\nDid you go outside today too?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67200,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "오늘은 안 나갔습니다\nI didn’t go out today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 68680,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "에어컨 틀어져 있나요?\nIs the air conditioner on?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 70560,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "지금은 꺼져 있는데요\nIt’s off right now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73120,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "오전에 저 라이브 할 동안, 몇 시간 동안 켜뒀습니다\nI left it on for a few hours this morning while I was doing my live."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76640,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아~ 중간 중간에 끄시나 봐요, 에어컨\nAh~ so you turn it off from time to time, the AC."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79900,
    "dDurationMs": 1510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네!\nYep!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 81410,
    "dDurationMs": 2410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "파워 냉방으로 틀어야죠\nYou’ve got to use the power-cooling mode."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 83820,
    "dDurationMs": 4540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아 그게 저희 집에 이 에어컨 하나인데요\nAh, well, we only have this one air conditioner at our place,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 88360,
    "dDurationMs": 4630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "집을 시원하게 하려고 파워 냉방으로 틀어놓으면\nand if I turn it to power cooling to cool down the whole house,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92990,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "제가 있는 곳이 너무 추워져요\nthe place I’m in gets way too cold."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 96320,
    "dDurationMs": 1150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네네네\nYeah, yeah, yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97470,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아니! 그러면 태웅쌤이 안 춥기 위해서 지금\nNo! Then, so Taewoong-ssam won’t be cold, right now..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 101250,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그 밖에 있는 사람은 너무 더운 거 아니에요, 그러면?\nthe person outside is way too hot, then, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104930,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그렇죠\nRight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 106270,
    "dDurationMs": 1190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "근데 여름이잖아요\nBut it’s summer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 109410,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아 그러니까 덥죠\nOh, right, so it’s hot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111150,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "맞아 여름에 에어컨 안 틀면 진짜 덥죠\nExactly—if you don’t turn on the AC in summer, it’s seriously hot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114330,
    "dDurationMs": 1490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "저도 에어컨 틀어뒀어요\nI’ve had the AC on too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115820,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "최근엔 또 습하더라고요 되게\nLately it’s been really humid too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 118020,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "맞아요\nThat’s right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 119300,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "비도 많이 오고 하던데\nAnd it’s been raining a lot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122220,
    "dDurationMs": 3050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "여름 하면 사람들이 제일 많이 물어보는 건 그거 같아요\nI think the thing people ask most in summer is that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 125270,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"여름 휴가 다녀오셨어요?\" 이런 거 많이 얘기하는데\nPeople often say, \"Did you go on your summer vacation?\" things like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 128830,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "태웅쌤은 어디 다녀오셨나요?\nWhere did you go, Taewoong-ssam?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131020,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "저는 다녀온 곳은 없고요\nI didn’t go anywhere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133510,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "최근에 제 유튜브 라이브 하면서\nRecently, while doing a live stream on my YouTube,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137250,
    "dDurationMs": 6010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "어디 태국에 있는 열대섬을 배경으로 한 게임을 하면서\nI played a game set on a tropical island in Thailand"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 143260,
    "dDurationMs": 5210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "구독자님들과 함께 한 일주일 정도 여행을 다녀왔습니다\nand went on a weeklong trip with my subscribers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 148470,
    "dDurationMs": 3650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "게임 속에서~ 게임이 좋은 점이죠\nInside the game~ That’s the nice thing about games."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 152120,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그렇게 방 안에서 여행도 할 수 있고\nYou can travel while staying in your room."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 154980,
    "dDurationMs": 3010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "어? 그 걸어다니는 그 게임 하셨어요?\nOh? You played that walking game?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 157990,
    "dDurationMs": 2710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아니요 그건 아니었어요\nNo, not that one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160700,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "해적들이랑 싸우는 게임 했어요\nI played a game where you fight pirates."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163900,
    "dDurationMs": 1570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "싸우고 오셨구나\nOh, so you came back after fighting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165470,
    "dDurationMs": 740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네, 그렇죠\nYes, that’s right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 166210,
    "dDurationMs": 1750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "재밌게 잘 하고 오셨나요?\nDid you have fun?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 167960,
    "dDurationMs": 1510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "너무 재밌었습니다\nIt was so much fun."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169470,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아, 그래요? 잘했네\nOh, really? Nice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 171770,
    "dDurationMs": 4890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "저도 그냥 어디 가기가 오히려 좀 무서워서\nHonestly, I’m kind of scared to just go anywhere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176660,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그냥 실내 위주로 많이 돌아다니는 것 같아요\nSo I think I mostly just go around indoors."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 179810,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "영화관 많이 가고\nI go to the movies a lot,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 183320,
    "dDurationMs": 2770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "전시회 같은 거 보러 가고\ngo see exhibitions,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 186090,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "쇼핑몰 구경하고 그렇게 보내고 있습니다\nand wander around shopping malls, that’s how I spend my time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 190190,
    "dDurationMs": 4290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "여름, 그러면 태웅쌤이 겨울 좋아하시죠? 여름보다\nSo in summer, Taewoong-ssam, you like winter, right? More than summer?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 194480,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "저는 여름보다는 겨울이 좋아요\nI like winter more than summer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 197160,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그러면 이거 한번 얘기해볼까요?\nThen, how about we talk about this?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 199760,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "태웅쌤이 여름을 별로 안 좋아하는 이유랑\nWhy Teacher Taewoong doesn’t really like summer,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 202850,
    "dDurationMs": 2330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "제가 여름을 좋아하는 이유\nand why I like summer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 205180,
    "dDurationMs": 3350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "이렇게 얘기해보면 좋을 것 같은데\nI think that would be a good way to talk about it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 208530,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "왜 별로예요 여름이?\nWhy don’t you like summer?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 210790,
    "dDurationMs": 470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "좋습니다\nSounds good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 211260,
    "dDurationMs": 1670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "싫은 점들을...\nThe things you don’t like..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 212930,
    "dDurationMs": 3710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "일단 너무 덥잖아요 너무 더운데\nFirst of all, it’s just too hot. It’s so hot,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 216640,
    "dDurationMs": 2530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "저는 땀을 잘 흘리는 체질이라서\nand I’m someone who sweats really easily,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 219170,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아이 뭐 나가면 그냥 바로 줄줄 젖어요\nso as soon as I go outside, I’m just drenched."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 222330,
    "dDurationMs": 2890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아 다 그래요 다들 그러더라고요 친구들도\nAh, everyone’s like that. My friends too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 225220,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그렇죠 그리고 햇빛이 너무 세서\nRight, and the sunlight is so strong,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 229600,
    "dDurationMs": 4010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "막 피부도 막 타고\nthat my skin gets tanned and all that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 233610,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아 뭐 그게 나쁜 건 아니지만\nWell, that’s not necessarily a bad thing, but"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 235490,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "가끔 좀 따가울 때가 있어요\nsometimes it stings a little."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 237890,
    "dDurationMs": 2020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "선크림 발라도?\nEven if you put on sunscreen?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 239910,
    "dDurationMs": 1180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "전 안 발라요\nI don’t put any on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 241090,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아!!!\nAh!!!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 243330,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "미치겠네 선크림 발라야 돼요\nOh, come on, you have to wear sunscreen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247350,
    "dDurationMs": 2090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아 근데 전 바르지 않습니다\nAh, but I don’t wear it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 249440,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "따갑다면서요\nYou said it stings."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 252100,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그렇죠\nRight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 253660,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "옛날에 그래서 따가웠었는데\nSo back then, it used to sting,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 256830,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "지금은 제가 양산도 잘 쓰고\nbut now I use a parasol well,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 261050,
    "dDurationMs": 4390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그리고 모자도 잘 써서 그래서 괜찮습니다\nand I wear a hat too, so it’s fine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 265440,
    "dDurationMs": 1990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "근데 여름 싫어하시는 분들은\nBut people who don’t like summer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 267430,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "선크림 바르는 느낌 자체도 싫고\noften don’t like the feeling of putting on sunscreen, either,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270710,
    "dDurationMs": 4530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그것 때문에 여름도 싫다고 하더라고요\nand they say that’s why they hate summer too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275240,
    "dDurationMs": 4470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "맞아요 선크림 바르는 게...\nYeah, putting on sunscreen..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 279710,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아 뭐랄까?\nAh, how should I put it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 282190,
    "dDurationMs": 3770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "씻으면서 나중에 선크림을 또 씻어줘야 되잖아요\nWhen you wash up, you have to wash the sunscreen off later too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 285960,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그쵸\nRight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 287040,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "근데 만약에 그게 다 안 씻기면\nBut if it doesn’t all wash off,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 289940,
    "dDurationMs": 1990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그럼 피부에 더 안 좋은 거 아니에요?\nisn’t that even worse for your skin?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 291930,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아... 근데\nAh... but"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 294110,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그게 왜 잘 안 씻기죠?\nWhy is it hard to wash off?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 295280,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그냥 세수하면 다 씻기는데요?\nDoesn't it all come off when you just wash your face?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 297520,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "근데 그 선크림 성분이\nBut the sunscreen ingredients..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 300670,
    "dDurationMs": 6050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "뭔가 막 기름져서 좀 안 씻긴다거나\nI mean, they're kind of oily, so they don't wash off well, or..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 306720,
    "dDurationMs": 5570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "찌꺼기 같은 게 피부 작은 구멍에 껴있을 수 있잖아요\nThere could be residue stuck in your skin's tiny pores, you know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 312290,
    "dDurationMs": 1180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그럴 수 있죠\nThat could happen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 313470,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그래서 클렌징이 중요해요 좀 꼼꼼히 해야 돼요\nSo cleansing is important. You have to be really thorough."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 316740,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아 맞습니다\nOh, right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 318220,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그게 걱정이 된다 뭔가 안 좋을까 봐 더\nIf you're worried about that, like maybe it's bad..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 323420,
    "dDurationMs": 1750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그렇죠\nRight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 325170,
    "dDurationMs": 4690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그럼 화장하시는 분들은 엄청 더 그럴 거 아니에요?\nThen people who wear makeup must worry about it even more, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 329860,
    "dDurationMs": 450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그러니까요\nExactly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 330310,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그래서 화장도 안 하는 게 좋다 생각해요, 저는\nThat's why I think it's better not to wear makeup either, honestly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 334450,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "내추럴 뷰티ㅋㅋㅋ\nNatural beauty lol"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 336160,
    "dDurationMs": 1990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네 그쵸\nYeah, right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 338150,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아 근데 그런 말 너무 많잖아요\nAh, but people say that so much, you know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 340820,
    "dDurationMs": 4580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "선크림 안 바르면 타는 거는 둘째치고\nIf you don't wear sunscreen, never mind getting tanned,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 345400,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "빨리 노화가 된다라는 말이 있어서\nthere's this saying that you'll age faster,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 349030,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "선크림은 전 좀 많이 잘 바르고\nso I put sunscreen on pretty diligently"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 352350,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "안 바르면은 안 나가거나 하는 편이에요\nand if I don't, I just don't go out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 355870,
    "dDurationMs": 4550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그래서 너무 덥고 땀나고 해서 싫다\nSo it's just too hot and sweaty, and I hate that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 360420,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "근데 겨울은 너무 추운데\nBut winter is so cold..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 362660,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "겨울 너무 추워요\nWinter is so cold."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 365280,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "근데 겨울에는 껴입으면 되잖아요\nBut in winter, you can just layer up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 368900,
    "dDurationMs": 1670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "좋은 포인트예요\nThat's a good point."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 370570,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네, 껴입으면 되는데 여름은 더 벗어도\nYeah, you can layer up, but in summer, even if you take off more,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 374310,
    "dDurationMs": 4010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "더 시원해질 수가 없어요\nyou can't get any cooler."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 378320,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아 근데 저는 여름에 가장 좋은 점이\nAh, but the best thing about summer for me is..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 382360,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "껴입지 않아도 된다예요\nthat you don't have to layer up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 384970,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아 그래요?\nOh, really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 386610,
    "dDurationMs": 4650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네 그냥 티셔츠 하나만 입고 바로 나갈 수 있잖아요 밖으로\nYeah, you can just throw on a T-shirt and go straight outside."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 391260,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아 그건 그렇거든요\nAh, that's true."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 394530,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "근데 겨울 옷들이 좀 멋있고 이쁜 게 많아요\nBut winter clothes are often stylish and pretty."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 398930,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "근데 보통 그냥 집 밖에 나갈 때\nBut usually, when you're just going out of the house,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 402320,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "별로 멋있고 이쁘고 싶지 않아요\nyou don't really want to be stylish and pretty."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 404450,
    "dDurationMs": 2950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그냥 편하게 나가고 싶을 때 있잖아요\nYou know those times when you just want to go out comfortably?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 407400,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아 그래요?\nOh, really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 409920,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "오...?\nOh...?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 411690,
    "dDurationMs": 2770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "태웅쌤은 항상 멋있게 나가나요?\nTaewoong, do you always go out looking stylish?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 414460,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그럼요 전 잘 때도 멋있게 하고 자요\nOf course. I even sleep stylishly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 418400,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아 그렇구나 굉장히 멋쟁이네\nOh, I see. You’re quite the fashionista."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 421580,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "근데 거울을 볼 때마다 우리가 스스로 보잖아요\nBut every time we look in the mirror, we’re seeing ourselves, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 425030,
    "dDurationMs": 1090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네\nYeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 426120,
    "dDurationMs": 3370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그럴 때 이제 멋진 걸 보고 싶은 거죠\nSo then you want to see something stylish."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 429490,
    "dDurationMs": 1580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "나를 위해?\nFor me?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 431070,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그럼요\nOf course."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 432070,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아 대단한데...?\nWow, impressive...?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 433590,
    "dDurationMs": 6950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "전 그렇게까지 멋쟁이가 아니라서 껴입는 게 너무 귀찮아요\nI’m not that much of a fashionista, so layering is such a hassle for me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 440540,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "사실 저도 아니거든요ㅋㅋ\nHonestly, me neither, haha."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 445020,
    "dDurationMs": 6210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "근데 요새 집 앞에 잠깐 나갈 때는\nBut these days, when I just step out near the house,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 451230,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "누가 그렇게 막 한 겹 두 겹 세 겹 이렇게 껴입어요\nwho’s out here layering on one, two, three layers like that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 454260,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그냥 두꺼운 롱패딩 하나 딱 입으면\nIf you just throw on one thick long padded coat,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 457700,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "문제 해결이잖아요\nproblem solved, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 459320,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그래도 추운데 껴입을수록 따뜻해지잖아요\nStill, it’s cold, and the more layers you wear, the warmer you get."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 463280,
    "dDurationMs": 2150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그냥 티셔츠에 롱패딩만 입으면\nIf I just wear a T-shirt and a long padded coat,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 465430,
    "dDurationMs": 4530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "너무 추워서 가볍게 입을 수 있다는 게 가장 좋고\nit’s so cold, so being able to dress lightly is the best thing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 469960,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "기분도 너무 좋아요\nand it just makes me feel so good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 470860,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그렇게 가볍게 입고 가볍게 입고 밖에 나가도\nEven if you go out dressed lightly like that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 473650,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "조금도 추위가 느껴지지 않고\nyou don’t feel cold at all,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 476350,
    "dDurationMs": 5460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "바람이 불면 기분이 좋은 느낌이 전 좋습니다\nand when the wind blows, I like that feeling of feeling good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 481810,
    "dDurationMs": 2030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그렇군요\nI see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 483840,
    "dDurationMs": 5750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "몸에 열이 많이 있냐 없느냐 차이도 있는 것 같아요\nI think it also depends on whether you have a lot of body heat or not."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 489590,
    "dDurationMs": 4170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "맞아 아까처럼 땀을 흘리는지 같은 것도\nRight, like whether you sweat like you said earlier, too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 493760,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네 저는 몸에 열이 많은 편이라\nYeah, I tend to have a lot of body heat,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 496420,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "사실 겨울에도 그렇게 여러 겹 안 입고\nso even in winter I don’t really wear that many layers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 500580,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그냥 안에 이런 반팔티 하나 입고\nand I just wear a short-sleeve T-shirt inside,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 504250,
    "dDurationMs": 3230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "두꺼운 긴 잠바 하나 입거든요\nand one thick long jacket over it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 507480,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그냥 그러고 다녀요 저는\nThat’s just how I go around."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 510300,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "진짜요? 그래도 괜찮구나\nReally? Then I guess that’s okay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 512610,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네 아마 그 차이가 아닐까 싶네요\nYeah, I think that’s probably the difference."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 516350,
    "dDurationMs": 1510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "맞아요 밖에 나갔는데\nRight, when I go outside"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 517860,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "별로 추위가 안 느껴지고 더위가 안 느껴지면\nif I don’t really feel the cold or the heat"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 521740,
    "dDurationMs": 1970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그렇게 싫어할 이유가 없죠\nthere’s no reason to hate it that much"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 523710,
    "dDurationMs": 1990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그렇습니다\nThat’s right"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 525700,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "여름? 그나마 싫은 점은\nSummer? The one thing I dislike, at least,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 528220,
    "dDurationMs": 2570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "벌레 많은 거?\nis the bugs?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 530790,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그렇죠\nRight"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 531810,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네\nYeah"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 533580,
    "dDurationMs": 4530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "막 뭐.. 모기 날아다니고...\nLike... mosquitoes flying around..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 538110,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "뭐 다양하죠, 벌레들은\nWell, bugs come in all kinds"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 540730,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "요즘 모기 있어요? 어때요? 태웅쌤 집에?\nDo you have mosquitoes these days? How is it? At Teacher Taewoong’s place?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 544350,
    "dDurationMs": 3110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "응, 집에 있죠\nYeah, there are at home"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 547460,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "많지는 않은 것 같아요, 옛날에 비해서\nI don’t think there are many, compared to before"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 551420,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "되게 말이 웃겼다\nThat was so funny"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 553180,
    "dDurationMs": 3650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "집에 키우는 강아지 물어보듯이 물어봤어요\nYou asked like you were asking about a dog you keep at home"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 556830,
    "dDurationMs": 1490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그렇네요\nThat’s true"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 558320,
    "dDurationMs": 1050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"모기 (잘) 있죠~\", 이렇게\nLike, “There are mosquitoes, yes~,” like that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 559370,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네 잘 있구나\nYeah, they’re doing well"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 561800,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "1층이라서... 1층이죠?\nSince it’s the first floor... it is the first floor, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 564220,
    "dDurationMs": 1050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네\nYeah"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 565270,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "벌레와의 전쟁...\nA war with bugs..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 566270,
    "dDurationMs": 4530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "특히 여름에 심하겠어요 그렇습니다\nIt must be especially bad in summer. Right"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 570800,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "온갖 벌레가 다 나와요\nAll kinds of bugs come out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 573780,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "최근에 본 벌레는?\nWhat was the last bug you saw?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 575620,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "최근에 본 벌레?\nThe last bug I saw?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 577090,
    "dDurationMs": 3790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "콩벌레 같은 거?\nLike a pill bug?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 580880,
    "dDurationMs": 1780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "집에서요?\nAt home?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 582660,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네 근데 그게 콩벌레는 아닐 거예요\nYeah, but it probably wasn’t a pill bug"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 585820,
    "dDurationMs": 3890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "이거 톡 건드리면 동그르르르 말리는 벌레 있잖아요\nYou know, the bug that curls up into a little ball when you poke it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 589710,
    "dDurationMs": 4670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네 근데 비슷하게 생겼는데 정확히 콩벌레는 아니고 아무튼\nYeah, but it looked similar, just not exactly a pill bug, anyway"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 594380,
    "dDurationMs": 4370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "더 길게 얘기하고 싶진 않아요 이 주제에 대해서\nI don’t want to talk any longer about this topic"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 598750,
    "dDurationMs": 4180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아하 다양한 벌레를 볼 수 있구나\nAh, so you can see all kinds of bugs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 602930,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "저 이번 여름에 모기 한 번도 못 봤어요\nI didn’t see a single mosquito this summer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 605910,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "안 물렸어요\nI didn’t get bitten"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 608510,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아, 그래요?\nOh, really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 609410,
    "dDurationMs": 2020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네\nYeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 611430,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "음... 아, 근데\nMm... oh, but"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 614880,
    "dDurationMs": 3470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그렇게 디디님 집은 1층은 아니잖아요\nyour place isn’t on the first floor, right, Didi?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 618350,
    "dDurationMs": 820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네\nRight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 619170,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "좀 위에 있는 집이고\nIt’s a place up a bit higher,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 622390,
    "dDurationMs": 4590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "집에 있는 하수구 구멍이라고 해야 되나?\nthe drain holes in the house, or whatever you’d call them?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 626980,
    "dDurationMs": 3970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그런 구멍들만 좀 잘 관리하면\nIf you just manage those holes well,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 630950,
    "dDurationMs": 3350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "모기가 안 생길 수도 있지 않을까 생각을 해요 저는\nI think mosquitoes might not come around."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 634300,
    "dDurationMs": 2570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "맞아요 진짜 많이 안 봤고\nRight, I really hardly saw any."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 636870,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "어렸을 때는 모기 때문에 자다가 깨고\nWhen I was little, mosquitoes would wake me up while I was sleeping,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 639910,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "이러면 정말 싫었어요\nand I really hated that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 642730,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아 그렇죠\nYeah, right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 644030,
    "dDurationMs": 4460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "저는 비교적 최근 몇 년 전까지만 해도 그런 일 때문에\nEven just until a few years ago,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 648490,
    "dDurationMs": 1970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "잠을 설친 적이 많았는데\nI often lost sleep because of that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 650460,
    "dDurationMs": 1570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네, 자다가?\nLike, while you were sleeping?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 652030,
    "dDurationMs": 6530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네, 근데 이제는 제 캡슐형 모기장에서 자니까\nYeah, but now I sleep in my capsule mosquito net,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 658560,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "쉴드에서 자니까~\nsleeping in a shield~"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 660900,
    "dDurationMs": 4450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네, 그래서 이제 그런 문제는 전혀 없죠\nYeah, so now I don’t have that problem at all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 665350,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "모기...\nMosquitoes..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 667150,
    "dDurationMs": 4610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "모기 물리면 가장 간지러운 부분 어디라고 생각하세요?\nWhen you get bitten by a mosquito, where do you think it itches the most?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 671760,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그런 게 따로 있나요?\nIs there such a thing?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 674100,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "여기 물리면 정말 짜증난다\nLike, if I get bitten here, it’s so annoying."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 676590,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "발가락 사이?\nBetween the toes?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 679550,
    "dDurationMs": 1150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "발가락 사이?\nBetween the toes?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 680700,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "맞아 아, 전 근데 얼굴에 좀 잘 물려요\nYeah, but for me, I get bitten on the face a lot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 683820,
    "dDurationMs": 2590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "막 눈에 물리거나\nLike, around the eye,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 686410,
    "dDurationMs": 1580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그러면 좀 그렇죠\nthen that’s kind of awful."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 687990,
    "dDurationMs": 2870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "이렇게 가리고 다녀야 돼요\nYou have to go around covering it like this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 690860,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "저는 얼굴에는 한 번도 안 물려봤거든요\nI’ve never been bitten on the face."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 693590,
    "dDurationMs": 2830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아, 그래요? 사진이 있을 것 같은데...\nOh, really? I feel like there’d be a photo..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 696420,
    "dDurationMs": 2750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "눈에 이렇게 물린 적이 많아요\nI’ve been bitten around the eye like this a lot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 699170,
    "dDurationMs": 6040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "음~ 근데 저는 방글라데시 다녀온 이후로\nMm~ but after I went to Bangladesh,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 705210,
    "dDurationMs": 2450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "모기에 거의 안 물리거나\nI hardly ever get bitten by mosquitoes now,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 707660,
    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "모기에 물려도 안 간지러운 몸이 됐어요\nor even if I do get bitten, my body doesn’t itch anymore."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 711000,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그건 어떻게 된 거예요?\nHow does that happen?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 712320,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "이유는 모르죠\nI don’t know why."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 714020,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "엥\nHuh?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 715480,
    "dDurationMs": 1150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "근데 진짜 그래요\nBut it really is true."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 716630,
    "dDurationMs": 1990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "방글라데시에서 많이 물렸어요?\nDid you get bitten a lot in Bangladesh?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 718620,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그런 것 같아요\nI think so."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 722120,
    "dDurationMs": 1180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "뭐야?\nWhat?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 723300,
    "dDurationMs": 850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "진짜 그래요\nIt’s really true."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 724150,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그래서 몇 년째 모기 물려서 막 가렵고 그런 걸 안 느끼고 있어요\nSo for years now, I haven’t really felt mosquito bites or the itching and stuff."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 728790,
    "dDurationMs": 2020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아, 물려도 그냥?\nOh, even if you get bitten, you just...?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 730810,
    "dDurationMs": 1060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네\nYeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 731870,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "에? 뭐지?\nHuh? What is that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 733310,
    "dDurationMs": 5580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아니, 한국 돌아와서 한 2년 동안 제가 모기 안 물리는 거예요\nNo, after I came back to Korea, for about two years I wasn’t getting bitten by mosquitoes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 738890,
    "dDurationMs": 690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네\nYeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 739580,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그래서 진짜 신기하다 했거든요\nSo I thought, wow, that’s really strange."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 742340,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "근데 비교적 최근에 알았어요\nBut I found out relatively recently."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 744420,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "어, 물렸었네?\nOh, you were getting bitten?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 745700,
    "dDurationMs": 2170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "음,\nMm,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 747870,
    "dDurationMs": 4420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "이게 어릴 때 좀 더 그런 걸 잘 느끼는 것도 있지 않을까요?\nMaybe when you’re younger, you feel that kind of thing more easily?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 752290,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아 그럴 수도 있겠죠\nOh, maybe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 753730,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "간지러움 고통 이런 거를\nThe itching, the pain, that stuff."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 756210,
    "dDurationMs": 2810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그게 모기가 물면\nWhen a mosquito bites you,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 759020,
    "dDurationMs": 6200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그 자리를 피부가 막으려고 하나?\ndoes your skin kind of try to block that spot?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 765220,
    "dDurationMs": 2350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그래서 몸에서 반응이 일어나면서\nSo as your body reacts"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 767570,
    "dDurationMs": 3050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "간지럽다고 들었는데\nit gets itchy, I heard."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 770620,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "이제 몸이 좀 상했나 봐요...\nI guess my body’s gotten a little worn out..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 774240,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그래서 그 반응을 안 해서...\nSo it doesn’t react anymore..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 775710,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아니야 저도 막 간지럽고 뭐 미치겠고\nNo, I still get super itchy and go crazy and everything,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 779040,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "이런 게 오래됐어요\nit’s been like this for a long time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 781600,
    "dDurationMs": 2530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "나이 들면서 내성이 생기나 봐요\nMaybe you build up immunity as you get older."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 784130,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그런가 봐요\nMaybe so."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 786770,
    "dDurationMs": 2350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아무튼 겨울에는 모기 없잖아요\nAnyway, there aren’t any mosquitoes in winter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 789120,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그렇죠 벌레 없고\nRight, and no bugs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 791240,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "방에 초파리 안 날아다니고\nFruit flies aren’t flying around the room,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 794660,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "초파리가 너무 많아요 요새\nThere are so many fruit flies these days."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 797450,
    "dDurationMs": 830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "너무 많죠\nSo many, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 798280,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "과일 뭐 하나만 먹어도 나오고\nEven if you just eat one piece of fruit,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 801120,
    "dDurationMs": 990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "맞아요\nRight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 802110,
    "dDurationMs": 3490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "전기파리채를 그래서 요즘 달고 살아요\nSo lately I’ve been carrying around an electric fly swatter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 805600,
    "dDurationMs": 4780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "사실은 제가 최근에 생각한\nActually, I recently thought of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 810380,
    "dDurationMs": 4150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "엄청난 비즈니스 아이템 아이디어가 있거든요\nan amazing business idea."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 814530,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네\nYeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 815670,
    "dDurationMs": 3890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "왜 이 흐름에서 나오지? 정말 궁금하다\nWhy does this come out of nowhere? I’m really curious."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 819560,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그게 뭐냐면요\nAnd what is it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 822080,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "전기파리채인데요, 사실상\nIt’s an electric fly swatter, basically,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 824640,
    "dDurationMs": 6180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "전기파리채로 모기나 초파리 이렇게 잡으면\nwhen you use an electric fly swatter to catch mosquitoes or fruit flies like this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 830820,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "탁 소리 나잖아요\nit makes a popping sound, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 832410,
    "dDurationMs": 4970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그러면서 전기 반응이 딱 딱 되잖아요 이제 그때\nAnd then the electric reaction goes crack, crack, right? At that moment,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 837380,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[귀멸의 칼날 대사]\n\"벽력일섬!\" 이렇게...\n[Demon Slayer line]\n\"Thunderclap and Flash!\" like that..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 840220,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아니면 막 쓔앙! 이렇게\nOr like, swoosh! Like that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 843070,
    "dDurationMs": 6340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "멋있는 쿨 FX 소리를 딱 나오게 하는 거예요\nyou make a cool, awesome FX sound."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 849410,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "딱 잡았을 때?\nWhen you actually catch it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 850870,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네네 탁 할 때\nYeah, when it goes pop."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 853310,
    "dDurationMs": 3830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그래서 더 이상 날파리나 모기가 보일 때\nSo when you see gnats or mosquitoes anymore,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 857140,
    "dDurationMs": 4610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "'아 저거 또 있네 어떻게 잡지?' 이렇게 하는 게 아니라\ninstead of going, 'Ugh, there it is again. How do I catch it?'"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 861750,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "샥~! 이렇게 하는 재미가 있게...\nit becomes fun, like, 'Shak~!'"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 864840,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"너 죽었다...\"\n\"You’re dead...\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 866140,
    "dDurationMs": 4390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네, 그런 아이템 아이디어를 생각했습니다\nYeah, that’s the product idea I came up with."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 870530,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "굿즈로 괜찮겠는데요?\nThat could work as merch."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 872420,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그쵸?\nRight?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 874400,
    "dDurationMs": 1220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "엄청나지 않아요?\nIsn’t it amazing?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 875620,
    "dDurationMs": 5820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "만약에 그런 게 생긴다면 어떤 캐릭터 거 사고 싶으세요?\nIf something like that existed, which character would you want to buy?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 881440,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아... 어려운데\nAh... that’s hard."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 884110,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "어떤 소리가 나면 좋을 것 같아요?\nWhat sound would you want it to make?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 886070,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "벽력일섬인가요?\nThunderclap and Flash?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 887780,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아니요 벽력일섬은 아니에요\nNo, not Thunderclap and Flash."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 892000,
    "dDurationMs": 1310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "전기...\nElectric..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 893310,
    "dDurationMs": 2170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "저 광선검 광선검\nThat lightsaber, the lightsaber."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 895480,
    "dDurationMs": 2210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아 다스베이더\nAh, Darth Vader."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 897690,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "라이트 세이버 네\nLightsaber, yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 899700,
    "dDurationMs": 3250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그래서 그냥 지융~ 할 수 있게요\nSo it can just go zzzing~,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 902950,
    "dDurationMs": 2870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "어 있을 것 같은데 지융~ 없나\nHmm, I feel like there should be one... isn’t there?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 905820,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "제가 알기로는 그 전기파리채로 잡았을 때\nAs far as I know, when you catch it with that electric fly swatter,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 908550,
    "dDurationMs": 1580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "소리가 나게 하는 건 없어요\nthere’s nothing that makes a sound."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 910130,
    "dDurationMs": 3310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아 그렇구나\nOh, I see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 913440,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그거 대박 아이템인 것 같은데?\nThat seems like a huge hit?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 915520,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그니까 한번 해봐요\nExactly, give it a try."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 917500,
    "dDurationMs": 3950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "이거... 보시는 구독자님들 중에\nThis... among the subscribers watching,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 921450,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "이거 만들어서 팔게 되면\nif you end up making and selling this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 922800,
    "dDurationMs": 3410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "저한테 한 5%만 떼주십시오\nplease give me, like, 5%."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 926210,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "되게 후하다\nThat’s very generous."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 928200,
    "dDurationMs": 730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네\nYeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 928930,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "무료로 배포하셨네 아이디어\nYou gave away the idea for free."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 931730,
    "dDurationMs": 5460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "대신 양심껏 5% 저한테 매달 (- 보내주셔야 됩니다) 기부해주세요\nInstead, in good conscience, please donate 5% to me every month (- you have to send it) rather than that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 937190,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "맞아 맞아 맞아\nRight, right, right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 939310,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그래서 벌레가 너무 많다!\nSo there are just way too many bugs!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 941890,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "여름 음식도 많잖아요\nThere are a lot of summer foods too, you know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 943950,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "과일이 좀 많은 것 같아요\nI think there are a lot of fruits."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 946260,
    "dDurationMs": 1450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그런 것 같네요\nI think so too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 947710,
    "dDurationMs": 3950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그러면 디디님은 좋아하는 여름 음식 이런 거 있습니까?\nThen, Didi, do you have any summer foods you like?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 951660,
    "dDurationMs": 4110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "저는 냉면 좋아해서 여름에 먹는 평양냉면\nI like naengmyeon, so in summer I eat Pyeongyang naengmyeon,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 955770,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아니면 그냥 냉면 좋아해요\nor just naengmyeon in general."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 958050,
    "dDurationMs": 6160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "음~ 저는 평양냉면을 아직 한 번도 안 먹어봤고\nMm~ I’ve never tried Pyeongyang naengmyeon,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 964210,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그리고 그냥 냉면은 안 좋아해요\nand I don’t like regular naengmyeon either."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 967030,
    "dDurationMs": 3990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "일단 평양냉면이랑 냉면의 맛이 많이 다른가요?\nFirst, is there a big difference in taste between Pyeongyang naengmyeon and naengmyeon?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 971020,
    "dDurationMs": 1570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아 많이 다르죠\nOh, it’s very different."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 972590,
    "dDurationMs": 2390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아 그럼 다른 음식이구나 그냥\nOh, then they’re different foods, basically."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 974980,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "면도 다르고요\nThe noodles are different too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 976380,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "국물도 달라요 네\nAnd the broth is different, yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 978020,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "오케이 좋습니다\nOkay, good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 981440,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "다행이네요\nThank goodness."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 983690,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "왜 냉면이 별로예요?\nWhy don’t you like naengmyeon?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 985570,
    "dDurationMs": 4190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "일단은 면이 질기기도 하고\nFirst of all, the noodles are kind of chewy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 989760,
    "dDurationMs": 4540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그리고 그냥 그 육수 맛이 무슨 맛인지 잘 모르겠어요\nand also, I don’t really know what that broth tastes like."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 994300,
    "dDurationMs": 2020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "오~\nOh~"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 996320,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그냥 시큼한 맛?\nJust a sour taste?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 998080,
    "dDurationMs": 1390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "동치미맛?\nDongchimi flavor?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 999470,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "동치미맛? 아 그런가?\nDongchimi flavor? Oh, is that it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1001890,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "저는 근데 그런 시큼한 맛을 그렇게 좋아하지 않아서\nBut I don't really like that sour kind of flavor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1005090,
    "dDurationMs": 2650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아, 초계국수 이런 것도 그런 별로예요?\nOh, so you’re not into things like chicken noodle soup, either?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1007740,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그렇게 좋아하진 않아요\nI don’t really like them that much."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1010200,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아, 여름에 그 새콤한 게 입맛을 돋운다고 해서\nOh, in summer, they say those sour flavors help whet your appetite,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1015600,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "좀 그런 음식들이 많잖아요 새콤달콤\nso there are a lot of foods like that, right? Sweet and sour."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1019160,
    "dDurationMs": 3770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "새콤달콤 근데 저는 음식에서는\nSweet and sour... but with food,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1022930,
    "dDurationMs": 5550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그 맛을 좀 안 느끼는, 안 좋아하는 편인 것 같습니다\nI think I’m the type who doesn’t really taste that flavor, or doesn’t like it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1028480,
    "dDurationMs": 4190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아, 그러면 평양냉면 좋아하실 수도 있어요\nAh, then you might like Pyongyang naengmyeon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1032670,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "왜냐면 그거는 면이 질기지 않고\nBecause the noodles aren't chewy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1035580,
    "dDurationMs": 5310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그리고 국물이 새콤하지 않아요\nand the broth isn't sour."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1040890,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "좋네요 저는 냉면은 아니지만\nNice. I don’t like naengmyeon, but"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1044450,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "밀면은 그래도 괜찮거든요\nmilmyeon is okay for me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1047360,
    "dDurationMs": 4180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "밀면, 부산에 주로 있는 면 요리인데\nMilmyeon is a noodle dish mostly found in Busan,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1051540,
    "dDurationMs": 5330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "냉면이랑 비슷하게 차가운 면인데\nand it’s a cold noodle dish similar to naengmyeon,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1056870,
    "dDurationMs": 4890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "시큼한 맛이 덜하고\nbut with less of that sour taste,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1061760,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그리고 면도 질기지 않아요\nand the noodles aren’t chewy, either."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1065000,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "밀이니까?\nBecause it’s made from wheat?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1066590,
    "dDurationMs": 2150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네 면이 뚝뚝 끊어지거든요\nYeah, the noodles break apart easily."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1068740,
    "dDurationMs": 6430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그리고 빨간 양념장을 넣어서 매콤하게도 먹기도 하고요\nAnd you can also make it spicy by adding red seasoning sauce."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1075170,
    "dDurationMs": 7240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "근데 저는 그거보다도 들기름을 넣은 들기름 밀면,\nBut more than that, I like perilla oil milmyeon,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1082410,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아니면 들기름 소바\nor perilla oil soba,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1085450,
    "dDurationMs": 3190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "이런 거를 좀 여름 음식으로 좋아합니다\nfor a summer food like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1088640,
    "dDurationMs": 2230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "들기름 들어간 거?\nSomething with perilla oil in it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1090870,
    "dDurationMs": 680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네\nYeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1091550,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "밀면을 제대로 안 먹어본 것 같네요\nI guess I haven’t really had milmyeon properly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1094640,
    "dDurationMs": 2450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "좀 부산에 많은 것 같아서\nI think it’s mostly in Busan,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1097090,
    "dDurationMs": 1010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "맞습니다\nRight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1098100,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "면 요리가 되게 많다 지금 생각해보니까\nNow that I think about it, there are so many noodle dishes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1101800,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "음 맞습니다\nYeah, that’s right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1103390,
    "dDurationMs": 3490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "밀면 잘하는데 아는 곳 있나요?\nDo you know a good milmyeon place?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1106880,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아 부산에는 많죠\nOh, there are lots in Busan."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1108680,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그냥 유명하다는 곳 다 가면 맛있을까요?\nIf I just go to all the famous places, will they be good?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1111780,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "어 그렇죠\nYeah, pretty much."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1113740,
    "dDurationMs": 5490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "음 여름 음식이 또 면류 많고\nHmm, summer foods also have a lot of noodles and stuff."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1119230,
    "dDurationMs": 5270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아예 뜨거운 거 먹기도 하죠? 삼계탕?\nYou eat hot food too, right? Samgyetang?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1124500,
    "dDurationMs": 7850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "보통 복날에 삼계탕을 먹는 전통이 옛날부터 있으니까\nI mean, there’s been this old tradition of eating samgyetang on bok days."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1132350,
    "dDurationMs": 2590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "근데 저는 삼계탕도 안 좋아해요\nBut I don’t even like samgyetang."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1134940,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "오~ 삼계탕이...\nOh~ samgyetang..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1137960,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "치킨이 더 맛있어요\nChicken tastes better."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1140220,
    "dDurationMs": 1090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그쵸\nRight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1141310,
    "dDurationMs": 4130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네 닭을 먹는다면 튀겨먹고 싶은\nYeah, if I’m eating chicken, I want it fried."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1145440,
    "dDurationMs": 770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "맞아요\nExactly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1146210,
    "dDurationMs": 9120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그래서 삼계탕은 뭐 한국의 유명한 고유의 전통 음식이지만\nSo samgyetang is, well, a famous traditional Korean dish,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1155330,
    "dDurationMs": 6070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "뭐 그렇게 제가 맛으로 좋아하는 음식은 아니라는 거\nbut it’s just not something I like for the taste."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1161400,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "근데 가끔가다 그 되게 진하고 꾸덕꾸덕한\nBut sometimes that really rich, thick..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1165520,
    "dDurationMs": 5180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그 국물에 있는 삼계탕 먹으면 맛있던데?\nsamgyetang in that broth is tasty, though?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1170700,
    "dDurationMs": 2510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그 국물이...\nThat broth..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1173210,
    "dDurationMs": 1930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "밖에서 먹어봤어요?\nHave you had it outside?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1175140,
    "dDurationMs": 2450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "많이 먹어봤죠\nI’ve had it a lot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1177590,
    "dDurationMs": 5820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그러면 한 번쯤은 괜찮더라고요 여름에 한두 번 정도?\nThen once in a while, it’s fine, right? Maybe once or twice in the summer?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1183410,
    "dDurationMs": 3770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "잘하는 집에 가면 상관없이 맛있겠죠?\nIf you go to a good place, it’ll taste good no matter what, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1187180,
    "dDurationMs": 2350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "몸보신이라고 합니다 그런 거를\nThat’s called body care, that kind of thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1189530,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "몸을 생각해서 위해주는 음식을 먹는 거예요\nIt means eating foods that are good for your body."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1194050,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "맞습니다\nThat’s right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1195070,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그런 것도 있고 디저트도 많잖아요\nAnd there are lots of desserts too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1197470,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "빙수도 있고 아이스크림?\nThere’s bingsu and ice cream?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1200890,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "며칠 전에 전 요아정 먹었는데...\nA few days ago, I had Yoajeong..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1202900,
    "dDurationMs": 2890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아직까지 요아정 안 드셨나요? 그거 궁금하다\nYou still haven’t had Yoajeong? I’m curious about that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1205790,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "안 먹었어요\nI haven’t."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1209590,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "오... 맛있는데!\nOh... it’s good!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1212710,
    "dDurationMs": 6070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "저는 요거트를 사실 매일 아침에 먹거든요\nI actually eat yogurt every morning."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1218780,
    "dDurationMs": 1390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그래서 그런가?\nMaybe that’s why?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1220170,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "뭐 그게 특별한가? 이렇게...\nLike, what’s so special about that? Like this..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1223450,
    "dDurationMs": 940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "먹어봐야 돼요\nYou have to try it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1224390,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "근데 아침마다 요거트를 드세요?\nBut you eat yogurt every morning?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1226040,
    "dDurationMs": 4190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네 밥 먹고 후식으로? \n- 웰빙이죠 웰빙\nYeah, after eating? For dessert?\n- It’s wellness, wellness"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1230230,
    "dDurationMs": 1780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아니요, 그냥 아침에\nNo, just in the morning."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1232010,
    "dDurationMs": 1270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "우와, 대단하다\nWow, impressive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1233280,
    "dDurationMs": 2390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "일어나자마자, 일어나자마자 먹어요\nI eat as soon as I wake up, as soon as I wake up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1235670,
    "dDurationMs": 1060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "무가당\nUnsweetened."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1236730,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "무가당인지는 모르겠어요\nI don't know if it's unsweetened."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1239230,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아, 그래요?\nOh, really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1241240,
    "dDurationMs": 2390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그냥 몸에 좋으니까 먹는구나\nSo you just eat it because it's good for you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1243630,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네 그리고 아침에 일어나서\nAnd in the morning, when I wake up,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1246250,
    "dDurationMs": 4580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "빈속에 그냥 운동하러 가기는 좀 그래서\nit's a bit awkward to just go work out on an empty stomach,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1250830,
    "dDurationMs": 4210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "요거트 조금 먹고 나가면 좀 괜찮으니까\nso if I have a little yogurt and head out, it's a bit better."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1255040,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아주 훌륭합니다\nThat's excellent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1256640,
    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그래서 진짜 태웅쌤은 여름 음식 별로 기대되는 게 없겠어요\nSo then Teacher Taeung really doesn't have much to look forward to in summer food."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1259980,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "냉면도 별로고 삼계탕도 딱히 그렇고\nNaengmyeon isn't that great, samgyetang isn't really your thing either,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1263480,
    "dDurationMs": 1970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "요아정도 안 먹고\nand you don't even eat yoajeong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1265450,
    "dDurationMs": 2710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네, 사실 하나도 없죠\nYeah, honestly, there's nothing at all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1268160,
    "dDurationMs": 4950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "약간 산책 후에 돌아오는 길에 아이스크림 백화점 같은 데 들러서\nKind of on the way back after a walk, you stop by some ice cream department store or something,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1273110,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아이스크림 하나 사 먹고 이런 행복 없어요?\nand buy one ice cream and eat it—there's nothing happier than that, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1276430,
    "dDurationMs": 4410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "어... 나오면 다 녹을 것 같은데\nUh... when you take it out, it feels like it'll all melt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1280840,
    "dDurationMs": 1690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "먹으면서 가는 거죠, 집\nYou just eat it on the way home."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1282530,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아 되게 빨리 녹잖아요 날이 되게 더워서\nOh, it melts so fast because the weather is so hot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1285650,
    "dDurationMs": 920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그쵸 그쵸 맞아요\nRight, right, exactly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1286570,
    "dDurationMs": 3110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그니까 이제 그럼 막 손에 막 이렇게 막 흐르고\nSo then it just starts running all over your hands and stuff,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1289680,
    "dDurationMs": 740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네\nYeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1290420,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그럼 막 계속 이렇게 먹어야 되는 거 아니에요?\nThen you have to keep eating it like this, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1292840,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네 그쵸 그쵸\nYeah, right, right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1294780,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아휴 저 그렇게 긴박하게 먹고 싶지 않아요\nUgh, I don't want to eat that frantically."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1296840,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "하하하\nHaha."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1299020,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그러네 겨울에 나오면 그냥 평생 먹을 수 있는데\nYeah, if it came out in winter, you could just eat it forever."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1303300,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아 그러니까요\nExactly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1306470,
    "dDurationMs": 3710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아쉽습니다 과일은 좋아하세요 태웅쌤?\nToo bad. Do you like fruit, Teacher Taeung?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1310180,
    "dDurationMs": 1540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "과일도 안 좋아합니다\nI don't like fruit either."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1311720,
    "dDurationMs": 1100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "왜 이렇게 안 좋아하는 게 많지?\nWhy are there so many things you don't like?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1312820,
    "dDurationMs": 1250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아니 뭐 그럴 수 있죠\nWell, I guess that's possible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1314070,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "딱히 안 먹는구나\nSo you just don't really eat it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1316130,
    "dDurationMs": 880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네\nYeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1317010,
    "dDurationMs": 5580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(여름 과일) 수박, 복숭아, 포도 있는데 다 별로예요?\nFor summer fruits—watermelon, peaches, grapes—do you not like any of them?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1322590,
    "dDurationMs": 1660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "다 안 좋아합니다\nI don't like any of them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1324250,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "진짜? 좋아하는 과일 없어요?\nReally? You don’t like any fruit?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1327870,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "좋아하는 과일 하나도 없어요\nI don’t like any fruit at all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1329700,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "우와\nWow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1331380,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "딱 하나? 딱 하나? 코코넛?\nJust one? Just one? Coconut?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1333100,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "에? 특이하다\nHuh? That’s unusual."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1335040,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "근데 코코넛 밀크쉐이크로 먹을 때만 좋아해요\nBut I only like it when it’s a coconut milkshake."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1337520,
    "dDurationMs": 1550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아~\nAh~"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1339070,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그냥 코코넛을 먹는 건 아니고\nNot just eating coconut itself,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1341230,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그렇네요 그거 맛있죠 그거 과일인가?\nRight, that’s tasty. Is that even a fruit?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1344490,
    "dDurationMs": 1210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아무튼 쉐이크로 먹는 거\nAnyway, I have it as a shake."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1345700,
    "dDurationMs": 1610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그렇죠 네\nRight, yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1347310,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "토마토\nTomato."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1348430,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "토마토는 채소입니다\nTomatoes are vegetables."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1352690,
    "dDurationMs": 1820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아, 과일 아니고?\nOh, not a fruit?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1354510,
    "dDurationMs": 2050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네\nNo."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1356560,
    "dDurationMs": 4110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그러고는 뭐 다양한 옥수수도 있고\nAnd then there’s all kinds of corn too,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1360670,
    "dDurationMs": 2030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "먹을 게 많아요\nso there’s a lot to eat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1362700,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "옥수수 여름 작물인가요?\nIs corn a summer crop?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1365160,
    "dDurationMs": 390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그럴걸요?\nProbably?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1365550,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "여름에... 항상 먹던데요? 어머니가\nIn the summer... I always ate it, though? My mom did."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1368950,
    "dDurationMs": 3590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아 그렇구나 여름 작물이구나\nOh, I see. So it is a summer crop."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1372540,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그러면 저 콘칩 좋아해서\nThen I like Corn Chips,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1376290,
    "dDurationMs": 730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네\nYeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1377020,
    "dDurationMs": 3710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그때 생산되는 콘칩 좀 맛있겠네요\nThe Corn Chips made in that season probably taste really good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1380730,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "과자는 잘 드시잖아요\nYou do like snacks, though."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1383630,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네\nYeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1384630,
    "dDurationMs": 2590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "좋아하는 디저트가 과자구나\nSo your favorite dessert is snacks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1387220,
    "dDurationMs": 1660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네\nYeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1388880,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아이스크림도 좋아합니다 아이스크림 사실\nI also like ice cream—ice cream, actually."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1390980,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네\nYeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1392060,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "근데 전 투게더 좋아해요 투게더\nBut I like Together. Together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1394760,
    "dDurationMs": 3810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "투게더에 올리브유 뿌려서 드셔 보셨습니까?\nHave you tried drizzling olive oil on Together?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1398570,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아니요\nNo."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1399970,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "진짜 맛있어요\nIt’s seriously delicious."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1402970,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "유명한 레시피에요?\nIs that a famous recipe?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1404740,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네\nYes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1407620,
    "dDurationMs": 2930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "원래 인터넷에 도는 레시피에는\nIn the recipes that are going around online,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1410550,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "올리브유랑 같이 후추도 뿌리라고 하는데\nthey say to sprinkle pepper along with the olive oil,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1414950,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "후추까지 안 뿌려도 그냥 올리브유만 뿌려도 진짜 맛있거든요\nbut even if you don’t add the pepper, just the olive oil alone is seriously delicious."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1419590,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네 먹어야겠다\nYeah, I have to try that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1421570,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그게 어떠냐면 한번 다음에 해보세요\nThe way it works is, try it next time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1424610,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그냥 투게더를 사서 처음에 먹어요\nJust buy a tub of Together and eat it first,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1428770,
    "dDurationMs": 2050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아무것도 안 뿌리고\nwith nothing on it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1430820,
    "dDurationMs": 2750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그러면 투게더가 진짜 달고 맛있어요\nThen Together is really sweet and delicious."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1433570,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "이제 거기에다가 올리브유를 뿌려서 먹잖아요\nThen you pour olive oil on it and eat it, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1437410,
    "dDurationMs": 2450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그럼 더 달아져요\nThen it gets even sweeter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1439860,
    "dDurationMs": 3820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "더 달고 그 맛이 깊어지거든요\nIt gets sweeter, and the flavor gets deeper."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1443680,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그렇게 올리브유 뿌린 거를 먹고 나서\nAfter you eat it with the olive oil on it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1447070,
    "dDurationMs": 2740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "다시 그냥 투게더만 먹잖아요\nwhen you go back to just eating Together by itself,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1449810,
    "dDurationMs": 2650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그럼 맛이 안 느껴져요\nyou can’t taste it anymore."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1452460,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "올리브유 뭐야!\nOlive oil, what the—!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1454110,
    "dDurationMs": 6150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그러니까요 그게.. 맛의 시너지\nExactly. That’s... flavor synergy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1460260,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "투게더가 바닐라 아이스크림이거든요\nTogether is vanilla ice cream, by the way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1464400,
    "dDurationMs": 4430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "이거 외국에서 듣고 계시는 분들도 해볼 수 있을 것 같네요\nI think people listening from abroad can try this too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1468830,
    "dDurationMs": 4710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "바닐라 아이스크림에 올리브유를 살짝 뿌려서 드셔보십시오\nTry drizzling a little olive oil over vanilla ice cream."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1473540,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그게 너무 달아지니까 후추 좀 치나 보다\nBecause it gets so sweet, maybe that’s why you add a little pepper."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1477120,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그런가 싶기도 하고\nI guess that could be it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1479320,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "매콤해지니까\nBecause it gets a little spicy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1481080,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "음.. 이거 얘기 안 할 수 없네요\nMm... I have to talk about this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1483900,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아이스 아메리카노 드세요?\nDo you drink iced Americano?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1486880,
    "dDurationMs": 2390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "저는 커피를 안 먹어서\nI don’t drink coffee,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1489270,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아, 그랬던 거 같네요\nAh, I think that was the case."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1491070,
    "dDurationMs": 1430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네\nYeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1492500,
    "dDurationMs": 4730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "저는 그 한국 와서 해봐야 될 것 중 하나가\nOne of the things I need to try when I come to Korea is,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1497230,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "메가 커피 같은 데 가서\ngoing to a place like Mega Coffee,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1499450,
    "dDurationMs": 8080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아이스 아메리카노 하나 들고 다니면서 먹기 요거 해봤으면 좋겠어요\nand walking around with an iced Americano in hand—I really want to try that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1507530,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "다른 나라들은 안그러나요?\nDo other countries not do that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1510630,
    "dDurationMs": 4860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아이스 아메리카노 이렇게 벤티 큰 걸로 잘 안 팔잖아요\nThey don’t really sell iced Americano in big venti sizes like that, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1515490,
    "dDurationMs": 4940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "뭔가 한국인들은 물처럼 마시는 것 같아요 아이스 아메리카노를\nIt feels like Koreans drink it like water, iced Americano."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1520430,
    "dDurationMs": 2510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아 그렇구나\nOh, I see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1522940,
    "dDurationMs": 5590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "제가 듣기로는 미국 같은 데는 텀블러 커다란 거를 다들 들고 다닌대요\nFrom what I’ve heard, in places like the U.S., everyone carries around these huge tumblers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1528530,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "웬만하면 가방에 이렇게 넣고\nIf possible, they just toss them into their bags like this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1530990,
    "dDurationMs": 2170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그래서 물을 많이 마시는데\nso they end up drinking a lot of water,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1533160,
    "dDurationMs": 5850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "한국인들은 그냥 이거 커피 마셔요 많이들\nbut Koreans just drink this—coffee, a lot of them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1539010,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네, 또 한국이 커피가 싸니까\nYeah, and coffee is cheap in Korea too,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1541570,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그렇게 하기 좋은 것 같아요\nso I think that makes it easy to do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1545150,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "2,000원 정도 하면 먹더라고요, 요즘\nYou can get it for around 2,000 won these days,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1548030,
    "dDurationMs": 430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네\nYeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1548460,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아이스커피는\niced coffee,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1551600,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "커피, 야, 근데 참 한국 사람들 대단하다\nCoffee—wow, but Korean people are really amazing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1554080,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그니까, 이만한 커피\nI mean, this much coffee,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1555700,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네, 사실 그게 약이잖아요\nYeah, really, it’s basically medicine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1559200,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네\nYeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1560460,
    "dDurationMs": 2510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "좀 부스터 같은 역할을 하잖아요\nIt’s kind of like a booster, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1562970,
    "dDurationMs": 1630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "맞아요\nRight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1564600,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "근데 그걸 그렇게 달고 살면\nBut if you live on that like that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1566520,
    "dDurationMs": 1510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그러니까\nExactly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1568030,
    "dDurationMs": 6700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "야 좀 건강한 사회인가? 모르겠네\nWow, is that a healthy society? I don’t know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1574730,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "근데 제 생각에는\nBut I think"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1576440,
    "dDurationMs": 5240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그 큰 커피는 샷이 많이 희석돼서\nthose big coffees dilute the shots a lot,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1581680,
    "dDurationMs": 3230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그렇게 카페인이 엄청 많고\nso it probably doesn’t have"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1584910,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그렇진 않을 거예요 아마도\nthat much caffeine or anything like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1587220,
    "dDurationMs": 3230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "제발 그랬으면 좋겠어요\nI really hope so."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1590450,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "디디님의 바램입니다\nThat’s Didi’s wish."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1593210,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "편하게 먹을 수 있게\nSo you can drink it comfortably."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1595970,
    "dDurationMs": 2810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그러면 태웅쌤은 여름을 별로 안 좋아하니까\nThen Taewoong-ssam doesn’t really like summer,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1598780,
    "dDurationMs": 5420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "제가 여름을 좋아하는 사람으로서 또 여름의 좋은 점을 이야기해보자면\nso as someone who does like summer, let me talk about another good thing about it:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1604200,
    "dDurationMs": 4410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "여름밤을 저는 정말 좋아합니다\nI really love summer nights."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1608610,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "왜요?\nWhy?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1609870,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "여름밤에는 해가 떨어졌기 때문에\nBecause the sun has gone down on summer nights,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1612540,
    "dDurationMs": 2950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "일단은 그렇게 덥지 않고\nso first of all, it’s not that hot,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1615490,
    "dDurationMs": 2810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "더워 미치겠다 할 정도로 덥지는 않잖아요\nit’s not so hot you’re dying from it, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1618300,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(정적)\n(silence)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1619860,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아닌가?\nIsn’t it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1621900,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "어, 네\nOh, yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1623420,
    "dDurationMs": 3550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그래서 산책하기 너무 좋고\nSo it’s really nice for going for a walk,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1626970,
    "dDurationMs": 4230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "분위기도 좋고 사람들 런닝도 많이 하고\nand the atmosphere is great, and people go running a lot,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1631200,
    "dDurationMs": 2390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "활기가 있는 느낌이라고 해야 될까요?\nshould I say it feels lively?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1633590,
    "dDurationMs": 5270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "겨울에는 이렇게 집에 다들 들어가 있고 하는데\nIn winter, everyone just stays inside like this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1638860,
    "dDurationMs": 3290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "사람들 그 야외 테이블에서\nand people are at those outdoor tables"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1642150,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "맥주 같은 것도 마시고 있고\ndrinking beer and stuff,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1644280,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "운동도 많이 하고 밖에 많이 나오고\nworking out a lot, going outside a lot,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1647580,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그런 살아있는 느낌? 좋아요\nthat kind of alive feeling? I like it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1650240,
    "dDurationMs": 3930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "오 밤에 나가는 걸 좋아하는군요\nOh, so you like going out at night."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1654170,
    "dDurationMs": 890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "밤에 좋죠\nNight is nice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1655060,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "여름은 밤이 좋아요\nSummer nights are nice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1657730,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아까 더워서 그냥 집에만 있으면 되니까 좋다\nEarlier you were saying it’s nice because when it’s hot, you can just stay home,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1662030,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "이렇게 얘기를 했는데 이제 밤에는 나가면 되니까\nand now you can just go out at night."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1665190,
    "dDurationMs": 6600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그쵸 그쵸 밤에... 안 나가고 살 순 없으니까 밤에 나가는 게 참 좋더라고요\nRight, right. You can’t live without going out at night... and going out at night is really nice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1671790,
    "dDurationMs": 3930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "어제도 잠깐 산책하고 왔는데 밤에\nI even went for a short walk last night,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1675720,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "사람 진짜 많고 확실히 살아있는 느낌이에요\nand there were so many people, it definitely feels alive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1680160,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그건 그렇죠\nThat’s true."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1683340,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그러니까 낮이 너무 뜨거우니까\nI mean, because it’s so hot during the day,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1686740,
    "dDurationMs": 430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그렇죠\nRight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1687170,
    "dDurationMs": 4010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "낮이 너무 뜨거우니까 그렇게 밤에 많이 나가는데\nbecause it’s so hot during the day, people go out a lot at night like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1691180,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "밤에는 자야 돼요\nBut you’re supposed to sleep at night."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1693780,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그것도 그래요\nThat’s true too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1698480,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "근데 또 좋은 점 생각났네?\nBut I just thought of another good thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1701300,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "여름이 낮이 길잖아요\nSummer days are long, you know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1704030,
    "dDurationMs": 830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네\nYeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1704860,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그것도 너무 좋지 않아요?\nIsn’t that nice too?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1707620,
    "dDurationMs": 4310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "긴데 즐기지 못해요 너무 더워서\nThey are long, but you can’t enjoy them because it’s so hot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1711930,
    "dDurationMs": 11050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아 \"어 지금 몇시지? 한 뭐 8시 됐나\" 했는데 6시고 그런 느낌\nAh, like, \"Oh, what time is it? Is it like 8 already?\" and it’s only 6, that kind of feeling."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1722980,
    "dDurationMs": 1730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "하루가 더 길어진 느낌\nIt feels like the day gets longer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1724710,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아 그건 그렇죠\nAh, that’s true."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1726660,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아 그래도 너무 뜨거워서\nBut still, it’s just so hot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1730560,
    "dDurationMs": 3490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "알겠습니다 여름 강요를 멈출게요\nGot it. I’ll stop forcing summer on you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1734050,
    "dDurationMs": 610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아닙니다\nNo, no."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1734660,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "근데 그 분위기가 좋긴 해요\nBut I do like that vibe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1737660,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그리고 저는 바닷가 쪽에 살잖아요\nAnd I live by the beach, so"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1740240,
    "dDurationMs": 7340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그래서 이런 여름에 밤에 저도 가끔 산책하면 덥긴 한데\nSo in summer like this, I sometimes go for a nighttime walk too, and it is hot, but..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1747580,
    "dDurationMs": 7690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그래도 다니면 여름 특유의 조개구이 집 냄새?\nStill, when you walk around, you get that unique summer smell of grilled shellfish?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1755270,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "조개구이 식당이 여러 개가 있거든요\nThere are a few grilled shellfish restaurants, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1757550,
    "dDurationMs": 2870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "저희 집에서 멀리 떨어지지 않은 곳에\nnot too far from my house."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1760420,
    "dDurationMs": 5790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "거기서 사람들이 막 왁자지껄 모여서 밥을 먹으면서 술을 마시면서\nPeople gather there all noisy and lively, eating and drinking,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1766210,
    "dDurationMs": 4860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "막 떠들고 그렇게 하는 소리가 들리면서 그 조개구이 냄새가 나는데\nand you can hear everyone chatting away while that grilled shellfish smell drifts out,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1771070,
    "dDurationMs": 990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그게 엄청 좋고\nand I just love that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1772060,
    "dDurationMs": 3820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그 분위기가 되게 낭만적이고\nThat atmosphere feels really romantic,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1775880,
    "dDurationMs": 8340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그리고 또 뭐 MT 아니면은 그냥 모임 친구들 모임이 놀러와서\nand then there are also MTs, or just friend hangouts—people come to visit,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1784220,
    "dDurationMs": 4450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "바비큐 같은 거 삼겹살 많이 구워 먹는데\nand they grill a lot of pork belly, like barbecue,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1788670,
    "dDurationMs": 5110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "이제 바닷가 냄새랑 그런 고기 굽는 냄새가 딱 섞이고\nand then the seaside smell and that grilled meat smell mix together perfectly,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1793780,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그 어두운 밤에 갈색 조명들이\nand in that dark night, the brown lights"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1798740,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "막 여기저기 켜져 있고\nare lit up all over the place,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1800930,
    "dDurationMs": 3910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그 분위기가 되게 예쁘긴 합니다\nand the atmosphere is really pretty."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1804840,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "휴가의 느낌이네요 다들 놀러 왔을 것 같고\nIt feels like a vacation—like everyone came here to have fun."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1808240,
    "dDurationMs": 3970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "맞아요 제가 관광지 쪽에 살아서\nExactly, I live in a tourist area,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1812210,
    "dDurationMs": 5260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "맛있겠다 바다에서 먹는 음식들\nYummy, the food you eat by the sea."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1817470,
    "dDurationMs": 7380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그렇죠? 여름 휴가 어디로 갈지 이런 것도 좀 취향이 갈리는 부분인데\nRight? Where to go for summer vacation is definitely one of those personal taste things,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1824850,
    "dDurationMs": 4990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "저희가 말로 하는 미니게임 시간에서 밸런스 게임을 해보려고 해서\nso in our spoken mini-game segment, we're going to try a balance game,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1829840,
    "dDurationMs": 3050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "뒤에서 좀 더 이야기해 보도록 하겠습니다\nand we'll talk more about it after this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1832890,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "좋습니다\nSounds good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1834290,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "이번 주 퀴즈 이런 거 얘기를 안 하고 바로 넘어가 버렸네요\nWe skipped right past this week's quiz without even talking about it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1838930,
    "dDurationMs": 4910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그래서 저번 주 퀴즈 정답부터 먼저 얘기하고\nSo we'll start by going over last week's answer,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1843840,
    "dDurationMs": 3850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "이번 주 퀴즈도 드리면서 마무리해 볼게요\nthen wrap up by giving you this week's quiz too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1847690,
    "dDurationMs": 4130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "저번에는 주제가 잠이었고요 퀴즈가...\nLast time, the topic was sleep, and the quiz was..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1851820,
    "dDurationMs": 4470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "태웅쌤과 디디의 자기 전 루틴이 아닌 것은? 이게 문제였고\nWhich of Taewoong's and Didi's bedtime routines is not one? That was the question,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1856290,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "정답은 3번 윔호프 호흡법이었습니다\nand the answer was number 3, the Wim Hof breathing method."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1860670,
    "dDurationMs": 6410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "이거는 태웅쌤이 아침에 하셨던 루틴이었죠?\nThat was the routine Taewoong did in the morning, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1867080,
    "dDurationMs": 2030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네, 함정 질문이었습니다\nYes, it was a trick question."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1869110,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "맞아요, 함정 질문이었는데 많이 맞춰주신 것 같고\nRight, it was a trick question, but I think a lot of you got it right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1872990,
    "dDurationMs": 5300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "이번주 퀴즈는 태웅쌤과 디디가 언급한 여름음식이 아닌 것은?\nThis week's quiz is: Which of the summer foods mentioned by Taewoong and Didi is not one?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1878290,
    "dDurationMs": 1550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "으로 하겠습니다\nThat'll be the question."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1879840,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "1번 라면\nNumber 1, ramen"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1881790,
    "dDurationMs": 1780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "2번 밀면\nNumber 2, milmyeon"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1883570,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "3번 냉면 입니다\nNumber 3, naengmyeon"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1886810,
    "dDurationMs": 5050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "이 중에서 저희가 오늘 이야기 하지 않았던 음식 골라 주시면 되겠습니다\nJust pick the food we didn’t talk about today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1891860,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그러면 다음 코너로 한번 넘어가 볼게요\nThen let’s move on to the next segment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1897340,
    "dDurationMs": 7910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "말로 하는 미니게임!\nA spoken mini-game!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1905250,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네, 이번 \u003c말로 하는 미니게임\u003e 시간에서는\nNow, in this \u003cSpoken Mini-Game\u003e segment,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1908650,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "밸런스 게임을 간단하게 해보려고 해요\nwe’re going to do a simple balance game."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1911710,
    "dDurationMs": 2630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "두 문제 준비를 해봤고요\nWe’ve prepared two questions,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1914340,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "더 좋은 거 골라주시면 됩니다\nand you just pick the better one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1917880,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "두 가지 중에서\nOut of the two."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1919520,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "여름에 좀 많이 이야기되는 주제고\nIt’s a topic that comes up a lot in summer,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1923040,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "첫 번째 주제는\nand the first topic is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1925820,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "바다 VS 계곡입니다\nthe sea vs. the valley."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1928940,
    "dDurationMs": 3930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "계곡은 산에 있는 그 피서지죠\nA valley is that summer getaway in the mountains."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1932870,
    "dDurationMs": 2630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "둘 중에 뭐가 더 좋으신가요?\nWhich do you like better?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1935500,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "하나 둘 셋\nOne, two, three."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1937960,
    "dDurationMs": 1310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "계곡!\nThe valley!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1939270,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "저희 둘 다 똑같이 계곡을 골랐는데\nWe both picked the valley too,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1942750,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "왜 계곡이 더 좋으신가요?\nso why do you like the valley more?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1944610,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "저는 맨날 바다를 봐요\nI always see the sea."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1946560,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그래서 계곡에 놀러 가고 싶어요\nSo I want to go play in a valley."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1949560,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "부산에 산 많이 없어요?\nThere aren’t many mountains in Busan?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1951840,
    "dDurationMs": 2350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "산은 많죠\nThere are plenty of mountains."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1954190,
    "dDurationMs": 7210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "근데 계곡 휴양지는 거의 못 본 것 같아요\nBut I don’t think I’ve ever really seen a valley resort there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1961400,
    "dDurationMs": 4710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "태웅쌤이 바다 근처에 사시니까 여름 바다와 겨울 바다\nSince Teacher Taewoong lives near the sea, between summer sea and winter sea,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1966110,
    "dDurationMs": 5520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "뭐가 더 여행하기 좋다고 생각이 드세요?\nwhich do you think is better for traveling?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1971630,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "여행하기 좋다...\nBetter for traveling..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1973730,
    "dDurationMs": 4450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "나 부산 바다 보러 갈 건데 여름에 갈까 겨울에 갈까?\nIf I said, 'I’m going to see the sea in Busan—should I go in summer or winter?'"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1978180,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "이렇게 물어본다면?\nif I asked like that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1979740,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "수영을 하고 싶으면 여름에 오고\nIf you want to swim, come in summer,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1983490,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그게 아니면 겨울이 좋지 않을까 생각합니다\notherwise, I think winter would be better."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1986590,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그냥 보기만 하려면?\nIf you just want to look at it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1988950,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네\nYeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1990660,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그러네요 아 수영도 자주 가끔 하세요?\nOh, I see. Do you go swimming often, by the way?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1995260,
    "dDurationMs": 2590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "요즘... 아 바다에선 한 번도 안 해봤죠\nThese days... oh, I’ve never done it in the sea."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1997850,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아 그래요?\nOh, really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1999200,
    "dDurationMs": 3190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "근처에 살아도 안 하게 되는구나\nEven if you live nearby, you still don’t end up doing it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2002390,
    "dDurationMs": 720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "저는 안 해요\nI don’t."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2003110,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "제가 아는 사람들도 안 해요\nThe people I know don’t either."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2004430,
    "dDurationMs": 3790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아 그래요?\nOh, really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2008220,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "저도 딱히 바다 수영을 안 해서\nI don’t really swim in the sea either, so"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2012160,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그냥 겨울에 가서 보는 게 좋은 것 같고\nI just think it’s nice to go in winter and look at it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2016540,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "여름엔 너무 더우니까 맞습니다\nIn summer, it’s just too hot, right? That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2019800,
    "dDurationMs": 1970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "바닷가에는 그늘이 없어요\nThere’s no shade at the beach."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2021770,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "어, 네\nOh, yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2022810,
    "dDurationMs": 2950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네 그래서 너무 힘듭니다\nYeah, so it’s really tough."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2025760,
    "dDurationMs": 3470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그래서 계곡이 좋은 것 같다고도 생각했습니다\nSo I thought valleys are nice too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2029230,
    "dDurationMs": 4850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "응 확실히 산이 더 시원해요 산 속이\nYeah, mountains are definitely cooler. In the mountains,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2034080,
    "dDurationMs": 1550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "계곡이 훨씬 시원하고\nthe valley is way cooler,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2035630,
    "dDurationMs": 4250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "물도 좀 맑고 깨끗하니까\nand the water is a bit clearer and cleaner, too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2039880,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "바다는 뭔가 찝찝하잖아요\nThe sea feels kind of gross, you know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2041620,
    "dDurationMs": 1990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "몸에 소금 있고\nThere’s salt on your body,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2043610,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "맞아요\nRight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2044810,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "해파리 있고\nand jellyfish,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2045950,
    "dDurationMs": 2050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "해파리 요새 문제죠\nJellyfish are a problem these days."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2048000,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네\nYeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2048800,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그래서 계곡이 좋은 것 같고\nSo I think valleys are nice,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2051900,
    "dDurationMs": 4660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "저번 해에는 계곡 다녀왔는데 올해 못 갔는데\nI went to a valley last year, but I couldn’t go this year,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2056560,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "저도 여름 휴가를 간다면 계곡 좋은 것 같습니다\nIf I were taking a summer vacation, I think a valley would be nice too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2060540,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "좋습니다\nNice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2061680,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그러면 두 번째 미니게임은 주제가 이거예요\nThen the theme of the second mini-game is this:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2065300,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "폭염 VS 장마입니다\nHeat wave VS monsoon season."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2068800,
    "dDurationMs": 5980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "엄청 뜨거운 여름 대 비가 많이 많이 오는 시즌\nA super hot summer versus a season with tons and tons of rain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2074780,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "뭐가 더 나은가인데 뭔가요?\nWhich is better? What is it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2077240,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "하나, 둘, 셋\nOne, two, three."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2079360,
    "dDurationMs": 480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "장마\nMonsoon season."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2079840,
    "dDurationMs": 1060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "폭염\nHeat wave."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2080900,
    "dDurationMs": 1690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "이게 갈렸어요\nThey split on this one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2082590,
    "dDurationMs": 5630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "장마... 장마 너무 그 꿉꿉하지 않아요? 습하지 않아요?\nMonsoon season... isn’t it so damp? Isn’t it humid?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2088220,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "근데 폭염도 꿉꿉해요\nBut heat waves are damp too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2093120,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "폭염 꿉꿉한가?\nA heat wave is damp?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2094600,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "폭염은 그래도 뽀송뽀송 하잖아요\nBut heat waves are still dry, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2096980,
    "dDurationMs": 1540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "어 안 그래요 안 그래요\nOh, no, no, no."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2098520,
    "dDurationMs": 1100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "진짜요?\nReally?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2099620,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네 저기 두바이 같은 곳 가면\nYeah, if you go somewhere like Dubai,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2103680,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "좀 건조하게 더운데\nit’s hot, but kind of dry."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2106280,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "한국은 그래도 습하게 더워서...\nKorea, though, is hot and humid..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2108640,
    "dDurationMs": 1310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "맞아 맞아\nRight, right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2109950,
    "dDurationMs": 2390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "꿉꿉합니다 똑같이 꿉꿉해요\nIt’s muggy. It’s just as muggy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2112340,
    "dDurationMs": 2450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아 저는 폭염을 고른 이유가\nAh, the reason I picked a heat wave is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2114790,
    "dDurationMs": 4490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그래도 여름에 또 장점 이야기하지 못한 것 중에 하나가\nbecause one of the summer perks I didn’t get to talk about is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2119280,
    "dDurationMs": 2230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "FULL HD로 보여서 좋다\nthat everything looks FULL HD."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2121510,
    "dDurationMs": 1910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "저는 이런 얘기를 많이 하거든요\nI say this kind of thing a lot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2123420,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "세상이 FULL HD인 것처럼 되게 햇빛도 강하고\nIt’s like the whole world is in FULL HD—the sunlight is so strong,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2128320,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "식물들도 초록색이고\nthe plants are all green,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2130500,
    "dDurationMs": 5180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그런 파란 하늘 요런 게 좋은데 폭염에...\nand that blue sky and all that... I like that, but in a heat wave..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2135680,
    "dDurationMs": 1730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "정말 보기에는 정말 예뻐요\nIt really is, it’s beautiful to look at."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2137410,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "나가서 너무 덥긴 한데\nIt’s so hot when you go outside, but"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2139970,
    "dDurationMs": 1160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "인정합니다\nI agree."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2141130,
    "dDurationMs": 1190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "감사합니다\nThank you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2142320,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "장마는 너무 흐리고\nMonsoon season is so cloudy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2144260,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "우울하고 졸리고 처지고...\ndepressing, sleepy, sluggish..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2147940,
    "dDurationMs": 6060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "근데 창문 열어놓고 딱 바람 휘 들어오게 하고\nBut if you open the window and let the breeze blow in,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2154000,
    "dDurationMs": 1150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "집에 불 끄고...\nturn off the lights at home..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2155150,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아! 너무 졸려요!\nAh! It makes me so sleepy!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2157210,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "작은 조명만 틀어놓고 하면 되게 아늑하고\nIf you just leave a small lamp on, it gets really cozy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2160190,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아 코지?\nAh, cozy?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2162020,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네네 무드 있어요\nYeah, yeah, it has a mood to it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2164990,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그런 느낌 좋아하시는 분들이 있더라고요\nThere are people who really like that kind of feeling."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2167810,
    "dDurationMs": 1630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "차분하고\nCalm and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2169440,
    "dDurationMs": 5450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네네 뭐라고 하나? 앰비언트 느낌?\nyeah, what do you call it? An ambient vibe?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2174890,
    "dDurationMs": 1810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그런 말이 있어요?\nIs that a thing?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2176700,
    "dDurationMs": 6590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네 커튼 막 이렇게 날리고 그런 거 좋아합니다\nYeah, I like it when the curtains are just fluttering like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2183290,
    "dDurationMs": 2510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "밤에 형광등 안 켜시잖아요\nYou don’t turn on the fluorescent lights at night,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2185800,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네\nRight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2186840,
    "dDurationMs": 4070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "바람 부니까... 좀 덜 더운 게 베스트군요\nBecause it’s windy... the best is when it’s a little less hot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2190910,
    "dDurationMs": 1630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그렇죠\nExactly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2192540,
    "dDurationMs": 6800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "계속 이제 비가 와요 오늘 촬영이 8시 20분... 아니, 8월 20일인데\nIt keeps raining now... Today’s shoot is 8:20... no, August 20th,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2199340,
    "dDurationMs": 2290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "계속 비가 예정되어 있거든요\nand rain is forecast to keep going."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2201630,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "여기 서울 근처는 경기도는\nAround here, near Seoul, in Gyeonggi-do,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2203940,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "부산 어떠려나\nI wonder how Busan is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2205500,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "부산은 그렇진 않네요\nBusan isn’t like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2207210,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네 맑습니다 아주\nNo, it’s very clear."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2208890,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그래서 이제 점점 선선해질 것 같아요 날씨가\nSo I think it’s going to gradually get cooler weather-wise."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2213990,
    "dDurationMs": 1430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "굉장히 아쉽고요\nThat’s such a shame."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2215420,
    "dDurationMs": 2590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "남은 여름을 만끽해 보려고 하고\nI’m trying to enjoy the rest of summer,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2218010,
    "dDurationMs": 6840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "태웅쌤은 무사히 이번 여름도 잘 넘기시길 지나가시길 바랍니다\nand I hope Teacher Taewoong gets through this summer safely too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2224850,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "제발 빨리 끝나면 좋겠다...\nI just really want it to end soon..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2228750,
    "dDurationMs": 3290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "제일 좋아하는 달이 언제였죠?\nWhen was your favorite month again?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2232040,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "10월이요\nOctober."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2233660,
    "dDurationMs": 2470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "다가옵니다 금방이에요\nIt’s coming up, it’ll be here before you know it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2236130,
    "dDurationMs": 4670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네 10월, 11월이 제일 좋아요\nYeah, October and November are my favorite."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2240800,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "다가옵니다 곧이에요 곧\nIt’s coming up soon, really soon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2242740,
    "dDurationMs": 4940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그런데 또 그런 것도 있는 것 같아요 부산이 서울보다 덜 추워요\nBut I think there’s also that thing where Busan is less cold than Seoul."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2247680,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아 맞네 맞아요\nOh right, that’s true."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2250650,
    "dDurationMs": 2540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "겨울에 부산 여행 가면 좋아요 그래서\nBusan is nice to visit in winter, so."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2253190,
    "dDurationMs": 1090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "맞습니다\nThat’s right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2254280,
    "dDurationMs": 3610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그러면 태웅쌤은 겨울이 더 좋다고 하셨으니까\nThen since you said you like winter better, Teacher Taewoong,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2257890,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "다음에 또 겨울 시즌쯤에 하게 되면\nif we do this again around winter season next time,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2261550,
    "dDurationMs": 2630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "겨울에 대해서 또 얘기해보면 좋을 것 같고\nit’d be nice to talk about winter again,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2264180,
    "dDurationMs": 4270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "다음 달은 어떤 주제로 이야기하면 좋을까요?\nWhat topic should we talk about next month?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2268450,
    "dDurationMs": 5790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "다음 달에 추석이 있는데 추석도 괜찮고\nNext month is Chuseok, so Chuseok would be good too,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2274240,
    "dDurationMs": 5700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "괜찮은데요? 추석에 명절 맞이로 친척들 만나고\nSounds good, right? Meeting relatives for the holiday during Chuseok"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2279940,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그런 이야기도 하고 하면 좋겠네요\nand talking about that kind of thing would be nice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2282940,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그러면 다음 달은 추석에 대해서\nThen next month, we’ll talk about Chuseok"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2285780,
    "dDurationMs": 3130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "또 요모조모 이야기해 보도록 하겠습니다\nand all sorts of things about it on Yomojoro again."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2288910,
    "dDurationMs": 3410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "오늘도 다들 끝까지 들어주셔서 감사합니다\nThanks, everyone, for listening all the way to the end today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2292320,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "요즘 요모조모에 자막을 번역을 달기 시작했더니\nEver since we started adding subtitles to Yomojoro translations,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2296200,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "더 많이 봐주시는 것 같고요\nit seems like more people are watching."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2298060,
    "dDurationMs": 5080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "이번 영상도 한번 시간이 되면 달아보도록 하겠습니다\nIf I have time, I’ll try to add subtitles to this video too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2303140,
    "dDurationMs": 1310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "감사합니다\nThank you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2304450,
    "dDurationMs": 1850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "감사합니다 화이팅!\nThank you, fighting!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2306300,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "오늘 약간 기운이 없으신 것 같아요 태웅쌤\nYou seem a little low on energy today, Teacher Taewoong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2308760,
    "dDurationMs": 1160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "괜찮으세요?\nAre you okay?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2309920,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "더워서 그래요\nIt’s because of the heat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2313180,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "이게 진짜다\nThis is the real deal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2314880,
    "dDurationMs": 1870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "힘이 쭉 빠져요\nIt just drains all your energy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2316750,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "정말? 아 태웅쌤... 푹 쉬세요... (- 기력이 없어)\nReally? Ah, Teacher Taewoong... please get some good rest... (- no energy)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2321250,
    "dDurationMs": 2330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "에어컨도 이제 좀 틀고\nTurn on the air conditioner now too"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2323580,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "감사합니다\nThank you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2324580,
    "dDurationMs": 4810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "아니 제 바로 뒤에 에어컨이 있어요\nNo, there’s an air conditioner right behind me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2329390,
    "dDurationMs": 4660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "에어컨을 키면 바람이 쑥 나와서 막 춥거든요\nIf I turn it on, the air comes blasting out and it gets really cold."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2334050,
    "dDurationMs": 4540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그렇다고 끄면 더워서 힘이 쫙 빠지고요\nBut if I turn it off, it gets hot and I just lose all my energy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2338590,
    "dDurationMs": 1780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "와...\nWow..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2340370,
    "dDurationMs": 2530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "현실 여름의 모습입니다\nThis is what summer in real life looks like."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2342900,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그러니까요 빨리 끝나면 좋겠습니다\nExactly, I hope it ends soon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2345780,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "이 힘든 시간이\nThis hard time"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2347500,
    "dDurationMs": 1370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "네 고생하셨습니다\nYes, good job."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2348870,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "그러면 저희는 다음 달에 또 돌아오도록 하겠습니다 감사합니다\nThen we’ll be back again next month. Thank you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2352950,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "지금까지 디디와\nThis has been Didi and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2355200,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "정태웅이었습니다 감사합니다\nJeong Taewoong. Thank you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2356790,
    "dDurationMs": 2770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "감사합니다\nThank you"
    } ]
  } ]
}
